<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said on Thursday it had started its coverage of Telefonos de Mexico S.A., or Telmex, with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Patrick Jurczak said in a report that the stock &quot;does not offer sufficient upside potential to warrant purchase at this time.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Telmex American Depositary Receipts, which opened unchanged at 31-3/8, have a target price of $36. &quot;ING Barings recommends investors purchase Telmex at a share price below $30.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
